    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "25 Belarmine Place is a beautifully presented 2-bedroom mid terrace home with light filled rear extension and a sunny westerly facing rear garden, ideally located within this premier Castlethorn built Belarmine residential development in Stepaside, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nOffering light filled accommodation throughout, the family home comprises a hallway, kitchen & breakfast room, living room, dining / sunroom with rear garden access and guest wc. The first floor is presented in landing, two double bedrooms (master bedroom with ensuite) and a family bathroom. There is potential to convert the attic (subject to conditions) thus increasing the accommodation to use as a home office or a family room. Outside, there is generous parking to the front and side whilst the low maintenance rear garden, which enjoys a sun filled orientation is presented in patio providing the perfect setting for children to play and for families to enjoy al fresco entertaining. A timber shed to the rear provides excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nNumber 25 is just a gentle walk from the bustling village of Stepaside with its superb range of boutique shops and eateries. The Belarmine development itself also offers facilities such as a supermarket, restaurant, pharmacy, creche and community centre. Other nearby amenities include Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business Park, Beacon South Quarter and Leopardstown Racecourse.\r\n\r\nThere is an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools nearby including Our Lady of The Wayside, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, Kilternan Church of Ireland NS, Stepaside Educate Together and Rosemont School. For the outdoor enthusiasts there are a wide range of activities including Hill walking, mountain bike trails, Kilternan Tennis Club, De La Salle Rugby Club, Wayside Celtic Football Club and approx. 80 acres of parkland at Fernhill Park and Gardens.\r\n\r\nThe area is well serviced by public transportation such as the Luas Green Line (Glencairn) which is just a short walk away. Dublin Bus No.44, 47 and 118. Also, close proximity to both M50 and N11 allows easy access to Dublin City centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful home is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers including first time buyers and those trading down alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTimber style flooring and alarm.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nTiled floor, fitted floor and wall units, tiled splashback, granite countertop, Zanussi oven and 4 plate hob, extractor fan, Bosch dishwasher, Beko washing machine, fridge freezer and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nTimber style flooring, feature fireplace with timber surround and double doors leading to:\r\n\r\nDining Room / Sunroom\r\nLight filled room with timber style flooring and double doors leading to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\nTiled floor, fully tiled walls, Villeroy and Boch wc and whb and wall mounted mirror.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nFitted carpet, shelved hot press and Stira access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet, storage and box bay window with window seat.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nTiled floor, fully tiled walls, step in shower, wc, whb with vanity unit, wall mounted mirror, chrome heated towel rail and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet and storage.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, bath with shower attachment, Villeroy and Boch wc and whb, wall mounted mirror and heated towel rail."
      },
      {
