        "Content": "• c.89 Sq.m / 957.99 Sq.ft\r\n• 2 double bedrooms \r\n• Master bedroom ensuite\r\n• Light filled rear extension\r\n• Beautifully presented throughout\r\n• B2 BER\r\n• Sun filled West facing rear garden\r\n• G.F.C.H.\r\n• Stepaside Village\r\n• Stepaside Educate Together & Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille\r\n• LUAS (Gallops or Glencairn Stop), Dublin Bus 44, 47 & 118, N11/M50 motorways"
